(7641488, 1240299, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love chasing hummingbirds too. I could also watch them for hours... mostly because if I have my camera, it takes me that long to get 1 out of a hundred that aren''t just blurry blobs.  Not easy to capture one with this kind of detail!  Way to go!</td>', 'I love chasing hummingbirds too. I could also watch them for hours... mostly because if I have my camera, it takes me that long to get 1 out of a hundred that aren''t just blurry blobs.  Not easy to capture one with this kind of detail!  Way to go!', '2019-09-16 01:18:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(7641489, 1240670, 24454, '<td valign="top">Johanna, you are SO GOOD!!!  Why on earth this didn''t win, I can''t figure...  but then, your style and art ALWAYS grabs my heart and appeals to my own "wannabe" style  :)</td>', 'Johanna, you are SO GOOD!!!  Why on earth this didn''t win, I can''t figure...  but then, your style and art ALWAYS grabs my heart and appeals to my own "wannabe" style  :)', '2019-09-16 01:21:46.000000', NULL, 0),
