(7641539, 1240788, 135744, '<td valign="top">This is a stunningly beautiful horse photo. I am never brave enough to try crops like this but it really works well here as you have cropped it perfectly. Really touching info behind this photo too - thank you for sharing this. And of course congrats on the ribbon.</td>', 'This is a stunningly beautiful horse photo. I am never brave enough to try crops like this but it really works well here as you have cropped it perfectly. Really touching info behind this photo too - thank you for sharing this. And of course congrats on the ribbon.', '2019-09-16 13:53:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(7641540, 1240807, 135744, '<td valign="top">To make something so ordinary look this amazing takes skill. And for that skill you have won a blue ribbon. Very nicely done - a huge congrats!</td>', 'To make something so ordinary look this amazing takes skill. And for that skill you have won a blue ribbon. Very nicely done - a huge congrats!', '2019-09-16 13:55:12.000000', NULL, 0),
