(7641586, 1240807, 52549, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by roz:</b></div><hr/><i> Irene .. shocking to hear the news about your husband .. my heart goes out to you and your family .. <br/>but hopefully its wonderful for you to get this little virtual blue ribbon .. for such a stunning IreneM image .. so totally you .. <br/>and maybe taking photos and getting such accolades can give you moments of happiness in amongst the hardships you guys are going thru .. i''m sending you very warm and compassionate thoughts right now .. xx ..<br/>ps .. CONGRATULATIONS ON THE BLUE .. !!! .. :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks so much for your comment, Roz. You''ve warmed my heart.<br/>And you''re right, taking photos does give me exquisite moments of happiness...<br/>Thanks also for the congrats - I''m sending you ((HUGS)) just because you''re you xx</td>', 'Originally posted by roz: Irene .. shocking to hear the news about your husband .. my heart goes out to you and your family .. but hopefully its wonderful for you to get this little virtual blue ribbon .. for such a stunning IreneM image .. so totally you .. and maybe taking photos and getting such accolades can give you moments of happiness in amongst the hardships you guys are going thru .. i''m sending you very warm and compassionate thoughts right now .. xx ..ps .. CONGRATULATIONS ON THE BLUE .. !!! .. :)   Thanks so much for your comment, Roz. You''ve warmed my heart.And you''re right, taking photos does give me exquisite moments of happiness...Thanks also for the congrats - I''m sending you ((HUGS)) just because you''re you xx', '2019-09-17 07:18:56.000000', NULL, 0),
