(7642053, 1240788, 34659, '<td valign="top">What a magnificent shot Sandy!  Congratulations on the Red Ribbon.  :)  Great story behind the photo too.  I can tell that Lily is a sweet sweet lady.  The way that you add such softness to your images, yet maintain the focus that you need is artistic and masterful.  Well done!<br/></td>', 'What a magnificent shot Sandy!  Congratulations on the Red Ribbon.  :)  Great story behind the photo too.  I can tell that Lily is a sweet sweet lady.  The way that you add such softness to your images, yet maintain the focus that you need is artistic and masterful.  Well done!', '2019-09-22 17:50:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(7642054, 1240807, 34659, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Irene!  Somehow (even after all these years), I just knew I recognized this work...  I couldn''t remember the artist''s name, but I knew the photog was quite talented and remarkable.  Then when the results came up, I was like - IRENE!  That''s it!  Well done and congratulations on a spectacular shot and another Blue.</td>', 'Congratulations Irene!  Somehow (even after all these years), I just knew I recognized this work...  I couldn''t remember the artist''s name, but I knew the photog was quite talented and remarkable.  Then when the results came up, I was like - IRENE!  That''s it!  Well done and congratulations on a spectacular shot and another Blue.', '2019-09-22 17:53:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(7642056, 1240772, 34659, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Tate!  I actually had this picked for the Blue - it garnered the highest score from me.  Fantastic concept, planning, execution, editing, and completion.  Very, very well done.</td>', 'Congratulations Tate!  I actually had this picked for the Blue - it garnered the highest score from me.  Fantastic concept, planning, execution, editing, and completion.  Very, very well done.', '2019-09-22 17:57:20.000000', NULL, 0),
