(7642058, 1240771, 34659, '<td valign="top">Love this!  The tones in the shot are so smooth and subtle and almost mystical.  It takes a deft hand to achieve that type of quality.  Well done and congratulations on your HM.  This had one of my highest scores.</td>', 'Love this!  The tones in the shot are so smooth and subtle and almost mystical.  It takes a deft hand to achieve that type of quality.  Well done and congratulations on your HM.  This had one of my highest scores.', '2019-09-22 18:00:11.000000', NULL, 0),
