(7642060, 1240847, 34659, '<td valign="top">Nice job!  Would love to have been there with you to experience the thrill of seeing it in person.  Congratulations on your top 10 finish with this great capture!</td>', 'Nice job!  Would love to have been there with you to experience the thrill of seeing it in person.  Congratulations on your top 10 finish with this great capture!', '2019-09-22 18:01:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(7642063, 1240640, 34659, '<td valign="top">I love love love this shot!  Congratulations on Top 10.  Underrated IMHO.  The rich dark tones and grittiness are terrific - and I really like the close-up crop of the composition.  It almost reminds me of an elephant''s knees (please ask my forgiveness from your model!).  I''m pretty sure that they are fingers, right?  Anyway, thanks for sharing your terrific work and great to see that you''re still on here!</td>', 'I love love love this shot!  Congratulations on Top 10.  Underrated IMHO.  The rich dark tones and grittiness are terrific - and I really like the close-up crop of the composition.  It almost reminds me of an elephant''s knees (please ask my forgiveness from your model!).  I''m pretty sure that they are fingers, right?  Anyway, thanks for sharing your terrific work and great to see that you''re still on here!', '2019-09-22 18:05:43.000000', NULL, 0),
